                                   "title":  "Swing Girls - Wikipedia",
                                   "snippet":  "Swing Girls (スウィングガールズ, Suwingu Gāruzu) is a 2004 Japanese coming-of-age teen musical comedy film co-written and directed by Shinobu Yaguchi. The plot follows a group of inept high school girls who form a big band. The cast includes Juri Ueno, Yuta Hiraoka, Shihori Kanjiya, Yuika Motokariya and Yukari Toyashima. [4] [5] The film ranked 8th at the Japanese box office in 2004 ...",
